{
  "name": "ambush",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 550.885,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 1.8,
      "text": "By the time you know you're in an ambush, it's already too late.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.576,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "cb80508f497e"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Teutoburg Forest, the Winter War, Vietnam.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.745,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "cb80508f497e"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "Ambushes have shaped battles across centuries.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.454,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "cb80508f497e"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "We'll examine how an ambush is constructed, how it unfolds, how a trained unit reacts when caught in one, and how drones are changing the way these engagements play out.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 10.828,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "cb80508f497e"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Three things make an ambush work: surprise, concealment, and the enemy being on the move.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.892,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "cb80508f497e"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "Take away any one of them and the advantage disappears.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.287,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "cb80508f497e"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Now, something most people haven't thought about.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.514,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3ec5f9e371ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "An ambush looks passive.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.004,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3ec5f9e371ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "You're hiding, but it's classified as an offensive action.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.038,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3ec5f9e371ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The ambushing force decides where the fight happens, when it starts, and what conditions the enemy faces the moment it does.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.597,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3ec5f9e371ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "The enemy decides none of that.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.952,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3ec5f9e371ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Everything in an ambush is built around this: the kill zone.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.961,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c629958cf750"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Where do we position?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.917,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c629958cf750"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "To cover this box.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.695,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c629958cf750"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "When do we fire?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.949,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c629958cf750"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "When the enemy is inside this box.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.471,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c629958cf750"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "When do we leave?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.808,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c629958cf750"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "When we're done with what's in this box.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.708,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c629958cf750"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Everything serves the kill zone.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.9,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c629958cf750"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 2.2,
      "text": "Keep that in mind.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.032,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c629958cf750"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Before anyone gets into position, the most important decision has already been made: location.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.317,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "edb22767f7ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Site selection accounts for most of the outcome.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.071,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "edb22767f7ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "The execution is almost secondary if the ground is right.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.432,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "edb22767f7ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Open ground is out immediately.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.617,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "edb22767f7ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "A straight road gives the lead vehicle a clear line of sight ahead.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/25.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.601,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "edb22767f7ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Something looks wrong, they just drive through.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/26.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.188,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "edb22767f7ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "A sharp bend behind a hill is ideal.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/27.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.103,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "edb22767f7ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "They can't see what's past the corner until they're already on it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/28.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.867,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "edb22767f7ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "And the bridge?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/29.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.88,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d66d3a98bc05"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "There is no other way across.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/30.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.156,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d66d3a98bc05"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "A choke point removes the enemy's choices before the fight starts.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/31.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.31,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d66d3a98bc05"
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "You know exactly where they'll be.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/32.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.521,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d66d3a98bc05"
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The ambush stops being a probability.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/33.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.196,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d66d3a98bc05"
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "It becomes a near certainty.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/34.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.37,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d66d3a98bc05"
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Two more things the site needs to give you: cover and concealment for your own force.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/35.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.825,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d4f3d4176b66"
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Concealment hides you.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/36.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.427,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d4f3d4176b66"
    },
    {
      "id": "37",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Cover stops bullets.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/37.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.574,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d4f3d4176b66"
    },
    {
      "id": "38",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 2.2,
      "text": "Good ground gives you both, and a clear way out, which we'll come to.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/38.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.261,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d4f3d4176b66"
    },
    {
      "id": "39",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Positioning.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/39.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.751,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "7ddf970ab9fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "40",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "And here's where most people's instinct gets them into serious trouble.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/40.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.667,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "7ddf970ab9fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "41",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Both sides of the road feels right.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/41.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.068,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "7ddf970ab9fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "42",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Maximum coverage.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/42.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.049,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "7ddf970ab9fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "43",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The problem is what happens at that crossing point.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/43.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.737,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "7ddf970ab9fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "44",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "At close ambush range, your fire paths cross directly through your own positions.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/44.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.32,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "7ddf970ab9fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "45",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "It's not a theoretical risk, but at least this is a mistake you only make once.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/45.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.575,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "7ddf970ab9fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "46",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "So, the formation itself has to solve this.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/46.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.948,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "6a12f63d4ddf"
    },
    {
      "id": "47",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The long leg runs parallel to the patrol's route.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/47.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.638,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "6a12f63d4ddf"
    },
    {
      "id": "48",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "This is the support element, your highest volume of fire.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/48.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.524,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "6a12f63d4ddf"
    },
    {
      "id": "49",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Notice the angle.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/49.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.259,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "6a12f63d4ddf"
    },
    {
      "id": "50",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Fire runs along the length of the kill zone, not across it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/50.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.967,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "6a12f63d4ddf"
    },
    {
      "id": "51",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "One burst covers the entire depth of the formation.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/51.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.249,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "6a12f63d4ddf"
    },
    {
      "id": "52",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "That's called enfilade fire.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/52.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.626,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "6a12f63d4ddf"
    },
    {
      "id": "53",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The short leg sits perpendicular at the far end.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/53.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.949,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "05b68ed59fe5"
    },
    {
      "id": "54",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Their job is to stop the patrol from walking forward out of the kill zone, and later, to move into it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/54.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.728,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "05b68ed59fe5"
    },
    {
      "id": "55",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "There's still a risk of friendly fire, but as long as the squad avoids this area, it's mitigated.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/55.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.267,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "05b68ed59fe5"
    },
    {
      "id": "56",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "It's where the fire paths from both elements come closest to intersecting.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/56.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.632,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "05b68ed59fe5"
    },
    {
      "id": "57",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Machine guns along the support element, and anti-armor at the ends.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/57.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.908,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "05b68ed59fe5"
    },
    {
      "id": "58",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Their one job at initiation is to stop the column moving, usually aiming for the front and back vehicles to trap in the rest.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/58.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.039,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "05b68ed59fe5"
    },
    {
      "id": "59",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "Ideally, there should also be security elements blocking both ends of the kill zone.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/59.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.059,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "05b68ed59fe5"
    },
    {
      "id": "60",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Everything is in place.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/60.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.363,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "616f9f650d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "61",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Now, it comes down to one thing: discipline.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/61.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.295,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "616f9f650d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "62",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The patrol enters the kill zone.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/62.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.876,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "616f9f650d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "63",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Nobody fires.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/63.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.956,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "616f9f650d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "64",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "This is harder than it sounds.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/64.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.404,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "616f9f650d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "65",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The target is right there, twenty meters.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/65.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.604,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "616f9f650d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "66",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The instinct is to shoot, but if one person fires now, they risk the coordination that makes the system lethal.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/66.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.097,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "616f9f650d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "67",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "Everyone waits for the commander's signal, and nothing fires before it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/67.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.132,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "616f9f650d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "68",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The anti-armor fires first.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/68.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.723,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "625b3cfb59aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "69",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Immediately after, the machine guns do their work.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/69.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.793,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "625b3cfb59aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "70",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Think about what's happening inside this box right now.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/70.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.136,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "625b3cfb59aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "71",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "They're trying to process fire coming from multiple directions simultaneously.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/71.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.983,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "625b3cfb59aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "72",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "There's no single thing to look at.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/72.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.457,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "625b3cfb59aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "73",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The mental cycle taught to them is to observe, orient, decide, act.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/73.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.351,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "625b3cfb59aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "74",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "But that collapses entirely in an ambush, and that's why it is so lethal.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/74.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.487,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "625b3cfb59aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "75",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "After the opening burst, sustained suppression is the aim.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/75.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.572,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "291b43580223"
    },
    {
      "id": "76",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The goal isn't to hit every target with every round.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/76.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.963,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "291b43580223"
    },
    {
      "id": "77",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "It's to make any movement inside that box impossible.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/77.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.634,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "291b43580223"
    },
    {
      "id": "78",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The patrol stays down.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/78.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.229,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "291b43580223"
    },
    {
      "id": "79",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Assault element moves in.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/79.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.388,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "291b43580223"
    },
    {
      "id": "80",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "Complete the action, collect anything useful: documents, radios, maps.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/80.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.11,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "291b43580223"
    },
    {
      "id": "81",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t13",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "And then, the withdrawal.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/81.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.73,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "b19abbaf875c"
    },
    {
      "id": "82",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t13",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "From the moment the ambush triggers, that clock is running.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/82.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.52,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "b19abbaf875c"
    },
    {
      "id": "83",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t13",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Reinforcements will arrive, and the tactical situation reverses.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/83.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.876,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "b19abbaf875c"
    },
    {
      "id": "84",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t13",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The ambush site goes from an asset to a liability the moment it's been used.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/84.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.89,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "b19abbaf875c"
    },
    {
      "id": "85",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t13",
      "gapAfter": 2.2,
      "text": "You leave.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/85.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.751,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "b19abbaf875c"
    },
    {
      "id": "86",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t14",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Now flip it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/86.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.745,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "f5fe6783cce1"
    },
    {
      "id": "87",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t14",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "You're in the patrol.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/87.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.237,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "f5fe6783cce1"
    },
    {
      "id": "88",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t14",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "And to be honest, if the enemy has planned it out well, the odds are most certainly not in your favor.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/88.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.092,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "f5fe6783cce1"
    },
    {
      "id": "89",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t14",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "But there are some things that minimize or increase your likelihood of making it out.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/89.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.252,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "f5fe6783cce1"
    },
    {
      "id": "90",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t15",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Contact, multiple directions!",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/90.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.1,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "bd4aad5c106e"
    },
    {
      "id": "91",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t15",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "People are down.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/91.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.767,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "bd4aad5c106e"
    },
    {
      "id": "92",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t15",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "You have seconds before confusion turns into hesitation.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/92.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.227,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "bd4aad5c106e"
    },
    {
      "id": "93",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t15",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Your first instinct is to go back the way you came.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/93.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.297,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "bd4aad5c106e"
    },
    {
      "id": "94",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t15",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "It feels logical, it's familiar, and it seems like the fastest way out.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/94.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.135,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "bd4aad5c106e"
    },
    {
      "id": "95",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t15",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "But that route is already covered.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/95.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.772,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "bd4aad5c106e"
    },
    {
      "id": "96",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t15",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Ambushes are set up with security elements watching the entry and exit.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/96.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.24,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "bd4aad5c106e"
    },
    {
      "id": "97",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t15",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "Moving back puts you right where they expect you.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/97.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.707,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "bd4aad5c106e"
    },
    {
      "id": "98",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t16",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Second instinct: take cover where you are.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/98.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.526,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3e754d073570"
    },
    {
      "id": "99",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t16",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Drop low, find anything solid.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/99.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.55,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3e754d073570"
    },
    {
      "id": "100",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t16",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "But the kill zone was chosen for a reason.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/100.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.456,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3e754d073570"
    },
    {
      "id": "101",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t16",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "What blocks one direction often leaves you exposed to another.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/101.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.543,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3e754d073570"
    },
    {
      "id": "102",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t16",
      "gapAfter": 1.6,
      "text": "There isn't a truly safe spot.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/102.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.024,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "3e754d073570"
    },
    {
      "id": "103",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t17",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The response that works has to be trained in advance, because it goes against instinct.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/103.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.491,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d4b88e83299b"
    },
    {
      "id": "104",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t17",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The correct move is to actually push toward the ambushing force.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/104.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.741,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d4b88e83299b"
    },
    {
      "id": "105",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t17",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Fast and aggressive.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/105.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.654,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d4b88e83299b"
    },
    {
      "id": "106",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t17",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "It sounds wrong, and yes, it can go wrong, but that is your only real chance.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/106.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.769,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "d4b88e83299b"
    },
    {
      "id": "107",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t18",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Ambushes are built around distance.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/107.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.3,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "ebf9e01690f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "108",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t18",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Positions, fire lanes, coordination, everything assumes you stay where you are.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/108.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.904,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "ebf9e01690f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "109",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t18",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The moment you move directly at them, that setup starts to fall apart.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/109.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.959,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "ebf9e01690f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "110",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t18",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Their angles don't line up the same way, and they're forced to react instead of follow a plan.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/110.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.24,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "ebf9e01690f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "111",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t18",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "You turn a one-sided situation into something more even.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/111.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.727,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "ebf9e01690f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "112",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t19",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "This only works if it's automatic.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/112.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.755,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "350645eb778f"
    },
    {
      "id": "113",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t19",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Under that kind of stress, people don't stop to think.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/113.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.706,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "350645eb778f"
    },
    {
      "id": "114",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t19",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "They fall back on what they've practiced.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/114.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.949,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "350645eb778f"
    },
    {
      "id": "115",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t19",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "If this isn't drilled in, it won't happen when it matters.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/115.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.991,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "350645eb778f"
    },
    {
      "id": "116",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t19",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "For a far ambush, beyond, let's say, fifty meters, the response changes.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/116.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.027,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "350645eb778f"
    },
    {
      "id": "117",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t19",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Return fire right away to reduce incoming pressure, then break contact by moving in small groups.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/117.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.228,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "350645eb778f"
    },
    {
      "id": "118",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t19",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "One element covers while another moves, repeating that process until you're out of danger.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/118.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.001,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "350645eb778f"
    },
    {
      "id": "119",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t19",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "It's slower and still risky, but closing the distance from that far away would leave you exposed too long.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/119.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.149,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "350645eb778f"
    },
    {
      "id": "120",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t20",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Distance decides the response.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/120.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.313,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "8bac19196a48"
    },
    {
      "id": "121",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t20",
      "gapAfter": 2.2,
      "text": "And in both cases, speed and clarity matter more than anything else.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/121.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.21,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "8bac19196a48"
    },
    {
      "id": "122",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Everything up to this point describes a classic ambush.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/122.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.571,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "731ca905d7df"
    },
    {
      "id": "123",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "But as you know, drones have changed the battlefield forever, and that includes how these engagements are carried out.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/123.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.597,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "731ca905d7df"
    },
    {
      "id": "124",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "I will show you three main ways a drone can operate in a modern setup.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/124.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.103,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "731ca905d7df"
    },
    {
      "id": "125",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The first is the sitting drone.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/125.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.379,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "731ca905d7df"
    },
    {
      "id": "126",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "This has been seen in Ukraine, on both sides.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/126.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.232,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "731ca905d7df"
    },
    {
      "id": "127",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Instead of soldiers lying in wait, a single drone, often a fiber-optic FPV, is placed directly on the road.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/127.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.516,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "731ca905d7df"
    },
    {
      "id": "128",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "It can remain there for hours, effectively blending in as debris.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/128.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.174,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "731ca905d7df"
    },
    {
      "id": "129",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "There's no need for troops in the tree line, no visible heat signature, and far less exposure for the attacker.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/129.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.096,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "731ca905d7df"
    },
    {
      "id": "130",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Its purpose is simple: wait for a vehicle to pass, then strike at the optimal moment.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/130.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.488,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "2928e187ee96"
    },
    {
      "id": "131",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Even well-used supply routes can be disrupted.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/131.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.341,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "2928e187ee96"
    },
    {
      "id": "132",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Surprise is the core principle here, and a stationary drone delivers it with a level of precision and concealment that's difficult to match.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/132.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 8.129,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "2928e187ee96"
    },
    {
      "id": "133",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "It appears only at the moment of impact.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/133.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.182,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "2928e187ee96"
    },
    {
      "id": "134",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The second change comes when drones operate together.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/134.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.959,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "2928e187ee96"
    },
    {
      "id": "135",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "One acts as a reconnaissance platform, circling above and searching for targets, while the other is the FPV strike drone.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/135.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.39,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "2928e187ee96"
    },
    {
      "id": "136",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "Once the scout identifies a target, it relays the location to the operator, who can launch the FPV and guide it in with little to no warning.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/136.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.947,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "2928e187ee96"
    },
    {
      "id": "137",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "What stands out here is that the kill zone is no longer fixed.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/137.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.9,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "313f343a3ed8"
    },
    {
      "id": "138",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "It doesn't depend on the enemy entering a pre-selected area.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/138.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.383,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "313f343a3ed8"
    },
    {
      "id": "139",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "It can be created on demand, anywhere the target is found.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/139.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.89,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "313f343a3ed8"
    },
    {
      "id": "140",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "That could be a road, an open field, or even a dug-in position assumed to be secure.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/140.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.764,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "313f343a3ed8"
    },
    {
      "id": "141",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "As a result, these attacks are no longer limited to movement or patrols.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/141.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.593,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "313f343a3ed8"
    },
    {
      "id": "142",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "They can happen during routine activity, even within areas that would normally be considered relatively safe.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/142.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.898,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "313f343a3ed8"
    },
    {
      "id": "143",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "The third way is defensive.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/143.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.171,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c0d4a7b255a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "144",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Modern units, down to the squad level, often carry their own drone.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/144.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.229,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c0d4a7b255a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "145",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "On patrol, if the terrain ahead looks unfavorable, there's no need to send a pair forward to check it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/145.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.473,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c0d4a7b255a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "146",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "A reconnaissance drone can be launched instead, scanning the exact ground the squad is about to move through.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/146.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.236,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c0d4a7b255a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "147",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "That tree line near a bend in the road.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/147.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.424,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c0d4a7b255a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "148",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Something that would normally rely on instinct and caution can now be observed from above.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/148.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.028,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c0d4a7b255a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "149",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "Subtle movement, difficult to detect from the ground, becomes much easier to pick up.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/149.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.236,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c0d4a7b255a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "150",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.45,
      "text": "Even dense foliage is less of a barrier, especially with thermal sensors.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/150.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.519,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c0d4a7b255a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "151",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t25",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "If a threat is identified early, the situation can shift quickly.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/151.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.296,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c70a051d0d0f"
    },
    {
      "id": "152",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t25",
      "gapAfter": 0.18,
      "text": "What might have been a successful setup can be disrupted, avoided, or even turned into a counter action.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/152.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.988,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c70a051d0d0f"
    },
    {
      "id": "153",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t25",
      "gapAfter": 0.9,
      "text": "Drones don't guarantee safety, but they significantly change the balance, making them increasingly standard at the small unit level.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ambush/153.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.645,
      "tempo": 1,
      "hash": "c70a051d0d0f"
    }
  ]
}
